{"id":"619415","name":"梅干菜哈饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/619415/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"手抓饼","amount":"3个"},{"name":"泡好的梅菜","amount":"一把"},{"name":"肉糜","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"清水","amount":"半碗"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅菜洗净浸泡。","img":"images/619415/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"取一些，撰干水分。","img":"images/619415/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切末。","img":"images/619415/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"葱姜切末。","img":"images/619415/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"切一些肉糜。","img":"images/619415/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/619415/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"油热放梅菜翻炒。","img":"images/619415/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放食盐。","img":"images/619415/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/619415/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"炒均匀。","img":"images/619415/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放清水。","img":"images/619415/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"盖锅盖煮。","img":"images/619415/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"汤汁快干。","img":"images/619415/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"放肉糜和葱姜翻炒均匀即可。","img":"images/619415/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"取手抓饼。","img":"images/619415/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"放上馅料。","img":"images/619415/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"再盖上一张饼，把边缘捏起来。","img":"images/619415/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"热锅冷油。","img":"images/619415/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"油热放梅菜哈饼。","img":"images/619415/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"盖锅盖焖一下。","img":"images/619415/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"底部变色。","img":"images/619415/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"翻面，反复两次即可。","img":"images/619415/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"取出来切开。","img":"images/619415/step_23.jpg"},{"step":24,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/619415/step_24.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅、平底锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}